    "# 12) Professional Gradio UX/UI\n",
    "\n",
    "The UI contains:\n",
    "- Structured enterprise case intake\n",
    "- Knowledge-base upload per specialty\n",
    "- Automatic agent routing\n",
    "- Score + decision dashboard\n",
    "- Specialist analysis tabs\n",
